		"_postman_id": "b7cd8fbf-3f94-4e8d-a219-f5ae950818f7",
		"name": "QAssure Module SSO Launch",
		"description": "Complete API collection for QAssure Platform Module SSO Launch system.\n\n## Overview\nThis collection contains all endpoints needed for:\n1. **User Operations** - Get accessible modules, launch modules\n2. **Module Verification** - Verify launch tokens (for LTTS module developers)\n3. **Super Admin Operations** - Enable/disable modules for tenants\n4. **Tenant Admin Operations** - Assign/remove users from modules\n\n## Authentication\n- **User Endpoints**: Bearer JWT token\n- **Module Verification**: X-API-Key header\n\n## Environment Variables Required\n- `base_url`: QAssure API base URL\n- `access_token`: JWT token from login\n- `module_api_key`: Module's API key for verification\n- `tenant_id`: Target tenant UUID\n- `module_id`: Target module UUID\n- `user_id`: Target user UUID\n- `launch_token`: Token received from launch endpoint",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "48835086",
		"_collection_link": "https://interview4tech4biz-3666547.postman.co/workspace/cost_it_right~89489571-f41b-4d4d-9740-4da5ee40bf88/collection/48835086-b7cd8fbf-3f94-4e8d-a219-f5ae950818f7?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=48835086"
	},
