								"description": "# ⭐ MAIN ENDPOINT FOR LTTS MODULE DEVELOPERS\n\n**This is the endpoint your module (COC, AiCE, etc.) must call to verify the SSO token.**\n\n## Full URL\n```\nPOST https://backendqassure.tech4bizsolutions.com/api/v1/modules/verify-launch-token\n```\n\n## Required Headers\n| Header | Value | Required |\n|--------|-------|----------|\n| Content-Type | application/json | Yes |\n| X-API-Key | Your module's API key | **YES - REQUIRED** |\n\n## Request Body\n```json\n{\n    \"token\": \"mlt_xxxxx...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Success Response\nReturns user info, tenant info, and access level.\n\n## Error Responses\n| Code | Message | Meaning |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| TOKEN_INVALID | Token not found | Invalid or tampered token |\n| TOKEN_INVALID | Token expired | Token older than 60 seconds |\n| TOKEN_INVALID | Token already used | Single-use token was reused |\n| API_KEY_REQUIRED | Missing X-API-Key | Header not provided |\n| INVALID_API_KEY | Invalid API key | Wrong key or not linked to module |"
